---
// The general partnership pitch, and the template every per-prospect page
// (/4windsweave, /sarahsmithweave, /gaiaweave…) is built from. The `partner`
// prop personalizes small bits of copy; the "weave" slot carries the
// brain/soul-storm section unique to that conversation — pages that don't
// fill it get the generic version below.
export interface Props {
  partner?: string;
}
const { partner } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="whero">
  <div class="container whero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Partnership</span>
    <h1 class="display h-1">Weaving the mycelium for a better future</h1>
    <p class="wlede">As incumbent systems crumble, we have the chance to build better ones — not by fighting the old, but by investing in the new.</p>
    {partner && <p class="wfor">A conversation with {partner}</p>}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">A partnership of carbon and silicon</h2>
    <p class="wbody">Lichen is a partnership between carbon-based intelligence and silicon-based intelligence — architected to build the infrastructure for a better way of sharing information, goods and services within the human family, and between humans and the planet.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection wsection--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">An entire ecosystem to heal, grow and be in better relationship with all that is</h2>
    <div class="wquad">
      <div class="wcol">
        <h3 class="wcol-title">Community</h3>
        <p>The corrective social network, where you can connect, host events, organize in groups, curate community and manage your schedule — one trusted web for your whole life, with no follower counts, no leaderboards, and nothing to perform for.</p>
        <a href="/about" class="wlink">Learn more about the network →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="wcol">
        <h3 class="wcol-title">Care</h3>
        <p>The Concierge service — a holistic, quantum healthcare system where your care team forms around you, while human wisdom and AI work together to track your Web of Wellbeing and coordinate the next, best step in your journey of healing and realizing your full potential.</p>
        <a href="/care" class="wlink">Learn more about the care model →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="wcol">
        <h3 class="wcol-title">Business</h3>
        <p>How the model supports the mission — a lean nonprofit with no investors to pay, where revenue flows back into expanding access to goods, resources and care for those in the network.</p>
        <a href="/business" class="wlink">Learn more about the business model →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="wcol">
        <h3 class="wcol-title">Platform</h3>
        <p>How the technology fuels the new economy and culture — one ecosystem where people, plants, animals, elements and land collaborate to restore individual, social and ecological harmony.</p>
        <a href="/platform" class="wlink">Learn more about the platform →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="wcallout">The commons is yours to shape. Every member controls whether their data is woven into the shared web, and whether they want Lichen&rsquo;s AI as a partner in realizing their purpose — never a requirement, always a choice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">An economy that closes the gap between money and value</h2>
    <p class="wbody">Underneath every exchange runs Lichen&rsquo;s Universal Current-cy — value tracked and honored, then translated back into the wider economy. The algorithm is still evolving toward something the current system never bothered to calculate: not just time, but the wisdom, skill and risk carried inside that time.</p>
    <ul class="wexamples">
      <li>An hour teaching carries the wisdom of everything that came before it — it isn&rsquo;t the same as an hour washing dishes.</li>
      <li>An hour building a custom table carries years of apprenticeship inside it.</li>
      <li>An hour fighting a fire carries real risk inside it — exposure, danger, the chance of not coming home.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="wbody">Lichen&rsquo;s economy is built to count all of it.</p>
    <a href="/economy" class="wlink">Learn more about the economy →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection wsection--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">It takes real people, choosing to build the new</h2>
    <p class="wbody">Lichen&rsquo;s business model and technology platform are architected to serve a better society — but it only comes alive when a critical mass of humanity chooses to withdraw its energy from failing systems and enliven a better one. That looks like three things:</p>
    <ol class="wpaths">
      <li><strong>Invest in a better future</strong> — subscription revenue funds the business and technology infrastructure a better society runs on, and everything beyond our lean operating costs pours back into the network&rsquo;s rebalancing work.</li>
      <li><strong>Scale a whole-earth renaissance</strong> — donations and seed gifts speed the platform&rsquo;s buildout and reach, growing the mycelium&rsquo;s capacity to restore balance, health and harmony.</li>
      <li><strong>Bring a better world to life</strong> — move your calendar, events, goods, services and social network onto the platform, and join a new vision of healthcare that transforms how we heal, grow and collaborate with all that is.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">You decide what&rsquo;s shared, and with whom</h2>
    <p class="wbody">Trusting technology to help build a better future isn&rsquo;t about the tool — it&rsquo;s about the consciousness of whoever&rsquo;s directing it. Until that feels safe, Lichen gives you full control over whether your data is part of the collective, and whether you want Lichen&rsquo;s AI as a partner at all.</p>
    <a href="https://lichen.health/collections/de300007-0000-4000-a000-000000000001" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="wlink">Go deeper on data, privacy and AI →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection wsection--alt wsection--center">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display h-2">This is your call to make</h2>
    <p class="wbody">Before we talk about what weaving in might look like, you know best — whether Lichen is a fit, and how to weave your own highest timeline into the tapestry.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fsection wsection wstorm" id="weave">
  <div class="container">
    <slot name="weave">
      <span class="eyebrow">The brain/soul-storm</span>
      <h2 class="display h-2">What weaving in could look like</h2>
      <p class="wbody">Every thread in the web is critical to its strength and flexibility in bringing about a better future — an individual joining as an alpha tester to make the platform better, an organization opening a public page and an offering, a community or group bringing its gatherings onto shared infrastructure, a place stewarding land inside the trust. Let&rsquo;s dream it up together.</p>
    </slot>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fband">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Questions, comments, compliments, next steps?</h2>
    <div class="wclose-ctas">
      <a href="mailto:connect@lichen.health" class="btn btn-light btn-up">Let&rsquo;s talk</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-up">Request an invitation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Desktop wants the copy to SPREAD (founder 2026-08-04): one consistent
     wide container for every section — no narrow column, no early wraps. */
  .whero { padding: var(--s-10) 0 var(--s-8); background: var(--bone-warm); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); }
  .whero-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-4); }
  .wlede { font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 24px); line-height: var(--lh-snug); color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 300; max-width: 72ch; }
  .wfor { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--t-sm); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--peach-deep); }

  .wsection { }
  .wsection--alt { background: var(--bone); }
  .wsection--center { text-align: center; }
  .wsection--center .wbody { margin-inline: auto; }

  /* :global() on the content classes below — a per-prospect page (like
     4windsweave.astro) provides its own "weave" slot markup, and Astro only
     auto-scopes styles to elements written in THIS file's own template, not
     to slotted children from the consuming page. Without :global() every
     custom page would need to redeclare this CSS itself. */
  :global(.wbody) { font-size: var(--t-lg); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--ink-soft); font-weight: 300; max-width: 82ch; margin-top: var(--s-4); }
  :global(.wbody + .wbody) { margin-top: var(--s-4); }

  /* The ecosystem box: one square, four quadrants (founder 2026-08-04 —
     Community | Care over Business | Platform). Hairlines form the cross. */
  .wquad {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin-top: var(--s-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: var(--bone-warm); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wquad .wcol { padding: var(--s-6); }
  .wquad .wcol:nth-child(even) { border-left: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); }
  .wquad .wcol:nth-child(n+3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); }
  .wcol { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-3); }
  .wcol-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--t-xl); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 400; }
  .wcol p { font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  :global(.wlink) { font-size: var(--t-sm); color: var(--peach-deep); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  :global(.wlink:hover) { color: var(--rust); }
  :global(.wcallout) { margin-top: var(--s-7); padding: var(--s-6); background: var(--bone-warm); border: 1px solid var(--peach); border-radius: var(--r-lg); font-size: var(--t-md); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 72ch; }
  :global(.wcallout strong) { color: var(--ink); }

  :global(.wexamples) { margin-top: var(--s-5); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-3); list-style: none; }
  :global(.wexamples li) { position: relative; padding-left: var(--s-6); font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  :global(.wexamples li::before) { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 10px; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--peach); }

  :global(.wpaths) { margin-top: var(--s-6); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-4); list-style: none; counter-reset: wpath; }
  :global(.wpaths li) { counter-increment: wpath; position: relative; padding-left: var(--s-8); font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: var(--lh-normal); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  :global(.wpaths li::before) { content: counter(wpath); position: absolute; left: 0; top: -2px; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--peach-tint); color: var(--peach-deep); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--t-sm); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  :global(.wpaths strong) { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

  .wstorm { border-top: 2px solid var(--peach); }
  :global(.wstorm .eyebrow) { color: var(--peach-deep); }

  .wclose-ctas { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--s-4); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--s-2); }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .wquad { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .wquad .wcol:nth-child(even) { border-left: 0; }
    .wquad .wcol:nth-child(n+2) { border-top: 1px solid var(--bone-edge); }
  }
</style>
